      "mode": "image",
      "prompt": "How the reference pictures align with the target video — Picture 1 (first frame) aligns with the 0.00-second mark; Picture 4 (last frame) aligns with the 8.00-second mark. Key frames 2 and 3 are anchored at 1.67s and 3.33s respectively.\r\n\r\nintegrated_multimodal_description:\r\n[Shot 1] Cinematic xianxia CG, soft daylight on a stone path through a bamboo courtyard with white flowering trees. The black-haired young man in moon-white robes (S2, calm low voice) stands on the left, hands clasped behind his back, turning his head slightly. The white-haired dragon-horned girl (S1, bright lively teenage voice) stands on the right, looking up at him with mouth slightly open as if asking a question. She says: <d>[中文] 师兄，你就教教我嘛。</d> The camera holds a steady medium two-shot.\r\n\r\n[Shot 2] At 00:02, cut to over-the-shoulder close-up from behind the young man's right shoulder. The girl on the right is in close-up, her blue eyes sparkling, one hand gently tugging his sleeve, cheeks slightly puffed in a spoiled expression. She says in a drawn-out whine: <d>[中文] 师兄——</d> Focus softens toward the young man on the left.\r\n\r\n[Shot 3] At 00:04, reverse over-the-shoulder close-up from behind the girl's left shoulder. The young man on the left fills the frame, his brows twitching almost imperceptibly, his cold expression softening into reluctant indulgence. He says with a slow breath: <d>[中文] ……行了，跟我来。</d>\r\n\r\n[Shot 4] At 00:06, wide back view of the two walking side by side along the stone path toward distant temple halls. The girl on the right says cheerfully: <d>[中文] 嘿嘿，师兄最好了！</d> The young man on the left replies dryly: <d>[中文] 话多。</d> Her hands gesture lightly as she talks, his robes ripple in the breeze, bamboo shadows dappling the path.\r\n\r\noverall_soundscape: Bamboo leaves rustling in a gentle breeze, distant temple bells, soft fabric rustle, footsteps on the stone path, birds chirping.\r\n\r\nnon_diegetic_music: A gentle xianxia melody of flute and guzheng at a slow, warm tempo, light strings shimmering softly in the background.\r\n\n",
